Personal Portfolio Website

Project Description

I developed a responsive personal portfolio website using HTML5 and CSS3. The website includes Home, About Me, Skills, Projects, and Contact sections to present my education, technical skills, projects, and career interests.

I used CSS Flexbox and Grid, consistent colours, project cards, hover effects, and media queries to create a user-friendly design for desktop and mobile screens. This project helped me practise semantic HTML, CSS styling, responsive web design, and website testing.

Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Flexbox and Grid
- Media Queries

Features

- Responsive design for desktop and mobile screens
- About Me and Skills sections
- Project cards to showcase projects
- Contact section
- Hover effects and consistent styling

Project Files

- "index.html" — Website structure and content
- "style.css" — Website styling and responsive layout
- "desktop.png" — Desktop screenshot
- "mobile.png" — Mobile screenshot
